Suggests: nvidia-smi
Homepage: https://github.com/corral1976/Pulse
Description: minimalist and elegant system monitor for the terminal
 Pulse-Active is a real-time system monitor featuring:
 .
  - Dual-mode display (GUI with colors, TTY with ASCII)
  - CPU, RAM, disk, network and temperature metrics
  - Quiet and one-shot modes for scripting and dashboards
  - Desktop integration with launcher and icon
